  "chapter": "Patient Administration",
  "description": "This query/response is designed for interaction between a client system and an MPI (Master Person Index). The query consists of a set of demographics for a person, and the response is the list of candidates considered by the MPI to match that set. \n\nEach returned person, specified by a PID segment, can also have an optional QRI - Query Response Instance segment containing information about the quality of the match.",
